{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"tools": [{"name": "human_eye_scene_observe", "description": "Current Blender facts. Task set example: {\"include_image\":false,\"query\":{\"mode\":\"task\",\"target\":{\"name\":\"A\"},\"candidates\":[{\"name\":\"B\"}],\"requested_facts\":[\"closed_solid_relation\",\"surface_proximity\"]}}. Unknown/duplicate rows remain. Complete penetration/nearest-separated sets require all relevant evidence; otherwise only known subsets are reported. Legacy objects pair/aabb supported. Global surface_nearest instead uses one query.objects selector without focal_id, or focal_id with query={\"mode\":\"surface_nearest\"}; session_id and include_image=false required. Complete means global nearest; partial means best-known. scene_revision/fingerprint bind this capture/source/revision; runtime_source_sha256 identifies code. Scene edits expire observations. Goals are caller criteria.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"task_instruction": {"type": "string"}, "focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "session_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "goal": {"type": "object", "description": "Optional caller-supplied task criteria, evaluated separately from execution. Omitted object IDs bind to the selected observation/action pair. These criteria are not independently verified as the human user's intent.", "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "target_clearance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "clearance_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "target_focal_pivot_world_m": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "number"}, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3}, "position_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "max_contact_normal_angle_deg": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 180}, "max_tangent_yaw_mismatch_deg": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 180}, "yaw_symmetry_order": {"type": "integer", "enum": [1, 2, 4]}}, "anyOf": [{"required": ["target_clearance_m"]}, {"required": ["target_focal_pivot_world_m"]}, {"required": ["max_contact_normal_angle_deg"]}, {"required": ["max_tangent_yaw_mismatch_deg"]}], "dependentRequired": {"target_clearance_m": ["clearance_tolerance_m"], "clearance_tolerance_m": ["target_clearance_m"], "target_focal_pivot_world_m": ["position_tolerance_m"], "position_tolerance_m": ["target_focal_pivot_world_m"]}, "additionalProperties": false}, "query": {"type": "object", "description": "Selectors use name OR id. Legacy exact_pairs/nearest/top1 use object_ids/max_exact_pairs. nearest needs complete exact nonpenetrating order; top1 may prune by strict outward bounds and reports ties. Unknown/budget-limited proofs do not certify nearest.", "properties": {"mode": {"type": "string", "enum": ["task", "surface_nearest", "overview", "exact_pairs", "nearest", "top1", "mesh_structure", "mesh_surface"]}, "objects": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}}, "oneOf": [{"required": ["id"]}, {"required": ["name"]}], "additionalProperties": false}, "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 4, "description": "Legacy task: aabb 1..4 selectors; pair facts two ordered A to B."}, "target": {"type": "object", "properties": {"id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}}, "oneOf": [{"required": ["id"]}, {"required": ["name"]}], "additionalProperties": false}, "candidates": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}}, "oneOf": [{"required": ["id"]}, {"required": ["name"]}], "additionalProperties": false}, "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 3, "description": "1..3 explicit candidates in request order; one capture with target. Requires closed_solid_relation and surface_proximity; aabb optional."}, "requested_facts": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["aabb", "center_delta", "axis_gap", "surface_clearance", "solid_relation", "nearest_witness", "pair_relation", "surface_proximity", "closed_solid_relation"]}, "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "description": "task: closed_solid_relation is zero-tolerance separated/touching/penetrating (positive-volume overlap, including containment) for represented connected closed triangle shells; invalid/ambiguous is unknown. surface_proximity independently gives nonnegative triangle-surface distance, original world witness points and positive-distance A-to-B direction; zero-distance direction is inapplicable. Boundary/nonmanifold counts do not certify solids. Penetrating/contained distances are not separated gaps. pair_relation's escape of A is not surface distance, nearest direction or minimum depth."}, "operation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["diagnose", "patch", "reference", "restore_preview", "reference_patch"], "description": "Registered target reads. mesh_structure: diagnose text or patch images. mesh_surface (local opt-in): diagnose/reference/restore_preview require include_image=false; reference_patch uses a returned opaque patch_ref and optional native images. References are locally trusted; previews do not execute; the original task budget applies."}, "request_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 128}, "near_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 0.001}, "threshold_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 0.01}, "reference_ref": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{32}$"}, "indices": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 4095}, "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 64, "uniqueItems": true}, "patch_ref": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{32}$"}, "task_ref": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{32}$", "description": "Trusted begin handoff, required in local lifecycle mode; selects the active generation without creating or renewing a task."}, "object_ids": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 255, "uniqueItems": true}, "label_object_ids": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 6, "uniqueItems": true, "description": "Current full IDs for image annotation, separate from measurement object_ids: up to six related labels plus A/B. Missing pair/image, occlusion or undersampling is explicit; display only."}, "max_exact_pairs": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 255}, "alignment_evidence": {"type": "boolean", "default": true, "description": "False omits optional face angles and requires include_image=false; strict distance, host rigid-frame and action checks remain."}, "support_plane_discovery": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "description": "Read-only discovery of bounded original support-plane selectors for the current focal/reference pair. Omit direction for geometry only; no action direction is invented.", "properties": {"direction_world": {"type": "array", "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3, "items": {"type": "number"}}, "max_candidates": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 6, "default": 4}}}, "native_visual": {"type": "object", "description": "Display policy only; never execution permission. Auto uses a negotiated read-only native host, otherwise the analytical projection. Projection skips negotiation; multiscale requires support. Labels and contact sections require projection.", "properties": {"mode": {"type": "string", "enum": ["auto", "projection", "multiscale"]}, "view": {"type": "string", "enum": ["SCENE", "XY", "XZ"]}}, "additionalProperties": false}, "visual_diagnostic": {"type": "string", "enum": ["contact_section"], "description": "Analytical full-mesh contact section beside natural views; not visibility evidence or action permission."}}, "allOf": [{"if": {"properties": {"mode": {"const": "surface_nearest"}}, "required": ["mode"]}, "then": {"properties": {"mode": {}, "objects": {"maxItems": 1}}, "additionalProperties": false}}, {"if": {"anyOf": [{"properties": {"mode": {"const": "task"}}, "required": ["mode"]}, {"required": ["target"]}, {"required": ["candidates"]}]}, "then": {"required": ["mode", "requested_facts"], "properties": {"mode": {"const": "task"}}, "oneOf": [{"required": ["objects"], "properties": {"target": false, "candidates": false}}, {"required": ["target", "candidates"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mode": {}, "target": {}, "candidates": {}, "requested_facts": {"items": {"enum": ["closed_solid_relation", "surface_proximity", "aabb"]}, "allOf": [{"contains": {"const": "closed_solid_relation"}}, {"contains": {"const": "surface_proximity"}}]}}}]}}], "additionalProperties": false}, "include_image": {"type": "boolean", "default": true, "description": "False returns text evidence without rendering. mesh_structure diagnose requires false and reads only the registered target raw mesh; patch may explicitly request images. Other observation modes retain default true."}, "task_context": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["task_id", "task_run_id"], "properties": {"task_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 128}, "task_run_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 128}}}, "scene_delta": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "description": "Optional observation-only snapshot transport. Empty object asks for full resync; a complete base revision and SHA256 enables a delta when worthwhile.", "properties": {"base_revision": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "base_fingerprint": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"}}, "dependentRequired": {"base_revision": ["base_fingerprint"], "base_fingerprint": ["base_revision"]}}, "response_detail": {"type": "string", "enum": ["full", "brief"], "default": "full", "description": "Optional display projection. Brief preserves measurements, scopes, unknowns and native image bytes while omitting named camera/raster diagnostics. Full is a new current observation, not retrieval of a previous observation. Errors and insufficient savings keep full."}}, "allOf": [{"if": {"required": ["query"], "properties": {"query": {"required": ["mode"], "properties": {"mode": {"const": "surface_nearest"}}}}}, "then": {"required": ["session_id", "include_image"], "properties": {"include_image": {"const": false}}, "oneOf": [{"required": ["focal_id"], "properties": {"query": {"not": {"required": ["objects"]}}}}, {"not": {"required": ["focal_id"]}, "properties": {"query": {"required": ["objects"]}}}]}}, {"if": {"required": ["query"], "properties": {"query": {"required": ["mode"], "properties": {"mode": {"const": "task"}}}}}, "then": {"required": ["include_image"], "properties": {"include_image": {"const": false}}, "not": {"anyOf": [{"required": ["focal_id"]}, {"required": ["reference_id"]}, {"required": ["goal"]}, {"required": ["scene_delta"]}]}}}], "additionalProperties": false}}, {"name": "human_eye_transform", "description": "Apply a guarded world-space rigid transform to the focal Blender object automatically preparing a fresh engine observation before its mandatory check. Translation is in metres; rotation is XYZ Euler degrees about the object pivot. The service checks the current revision and endpoint geometry, executes only accepted actions, and reads the actual scene back. An optional caller-supplied goal checks the actual result separately from execution verification. This does not certify a swept path or independently verify the caller's intent.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"action": {"type": "object", "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "translation": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "number"}, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3}, "rotation_euler_deg": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "number"}, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3}}, "required": ["focal_id", "reference_id"], "anyOf": [{"required": ["translation"]}, {"required": ["rotation_euler_deg"]}], "additionalProperties": false}, "session_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "goal": {"type": "object", "description": "Optional caller-supplied task criteria, evaluated separately from execution. Omitted object IDs bind to the selected observation/action pair. These criteria are not independently verified as the human user's intent.", "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "target_clearance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "clearance_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "target_focal_pivot_world_m": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "number"}, "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3}, "position_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "max_contact_normal_angle_deg": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 180}, "max_tangent_yaw_mismatch_deg": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 180}, "yaw_symmetry_order": {"type": "integer", "enum": [1, 2, 4]}}, "anyOf": [{"required": ["target_clearance_m"]}, {"required": ["target_focal_pivot_world_m"]}, {"required": ["max_contact_normal_angle_deg"]}, {"required": ["max_tangent_yaw_mismatch_deg"]}], "dependentRequired": {"target_clearance_m": ["clearance_tolerance_m"], "clearance_tolerance_m": ["target_clearance_m"], "target_focal_pivot_world_m": ["position_tolerance_m"], "position_tolerance_m": ["target_focal_pivot_world_m"]}, "additionalProperties": false}, "task_context": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["task_id", "task_run_id"], "properties": {"task_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 128}, "task_run_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 128}}}}, "required": ["action"], "additionalProperties": false}}, {"name": "human_eye_connection_status", "description": "Read the live service configuration and connection status without changing the scene.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {}, "additionalProperties": false}}, {"name": "human_eye_clearance_segment", "description": "Preview or execute a finite target-clearance segment. Legacy requests use exact world-axis boxes with an explicit signed world axis. Explicit solver=support_plane requests select an original reference triangle and a world translation direction; exact finite-plane certificates restrict their supported convex-mesh domain. Supply object IDs, target and tolerance; the engine computes translations and may correct confirmed residuals within the declared budget. execute defaults to false. Reuse the same request_id to retrieve a historical receipt, never to repeat motion. Every real step retains fresh geometry/precision checks and actual readback. Endpoint only; no swept path or in-flight cancellation is certified.", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"session_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "request_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "request": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "description": "A bounded goal request, never execution permission. Use the legacy explicit world-axis box constraint, or solver=support_plane with an explicitly selected original reference triangle and world direction. Each actual step still needs fresh whole-scene checks and readback.", "required": ["focal_id", "reference_id", "target_clearance_m", "clearance_tolerance_m"], "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "axis": {"type": "string", "enum": ["+x", "-x", "+y", "-y", "+z", "-z"]}, "target_clearance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "clearance_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "max_steps": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8, "default": 4}, "max_step_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "default": 0.01}, "max_total_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "default": 0.04}, "max_duration_s": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 30, "default": 5}, "reference_triangle_index": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}, "direction_world": {"type": "array", "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3, "items": {"type": "number"}}, "solver": {"type": "string", "enum": ["support_plane"]}, "selection_binding": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["scene_revision", "scene_fingerprint", "focal_id", "reference_id"], "description": "Initial captured-scene freshness and pair binding, never execution authority or verified user intent. Later steps retain their separate fresh checks.", "properties": {"scene_revision": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "scene_fingerprint": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}, "focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}}}}, "oneOf": [{"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["focal_id", "reference_id", "axis", "target_clearance_m", "clearance_tolerance_m"], "description": "A bounded goal request, never an execution permission. Version one supports exact world-axis box faces only. Axis points from reference toward focal; each correction may move either way along that axis.", "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "axis": {"type": "string", "enum": ["+x", "-x", "+y", "-y", "+z", "-z"]}, "target_clearance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "clearance_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "max_steps": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8, "default": 4}, "max_step_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "default": 0.01}, "max_total_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "default": 0.04}, "max_duration_s": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 30, "default": 5}}}, {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["focal_id", "reference_id", "solver", "reference_triangle_index", "direction_world", "target_clearance_m", "clearance_tolerance_m"], "properties": {"focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_triangle_index": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}, "direction_world": {"type": "array", "minItems": 3, "maxItems": 3, "items": {"type": "number"}}, "target_clearance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "clearance_tolerance_m": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0}, "max_step_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "default": 0.01}, "max_total_translation_m": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 4, "default": 0.04}, "solver": {"type": "string", "enum": ["support_plane"]}, "selection_binding": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["scene_revision", "scene_fingerprint", "focal_id", "reference_id"], "description": "Initial captured-scene freshness and pair binding, never execution authority or verified user intent. Later steps retain their separate fresh checks.", "properties": {"scene_revision": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "scene_fingerprint": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}, "focal_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}, "reference_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 256}}}, "max_steps": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 8, "default": 4}, "max_duration_s": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "maximum": 30, "default": 5}}}]}, "execute": {"type": "boolean", "default": false}, "include_image": {"type": "boolean", "default": false}, "task_context": {"type": "object", "additiona